    add("th2-chapter-1-msx-system-overview", "", "Handbook: Chapter 1: MSX system overview", "", "CHAPTER 1 - MSX SYSTEM OVERVIEW: The MSX2 was designed to be fully compatible with the...",
        R"MAN(LIVRO: MSX2 Technical Handbook (ASCII Corporation, 1987)
CAPITULO: Chapter 1: MSX system overview

The MSX2 was designed to be fully compatible with the MSX1, but there are many enhanced features in the MSX2. Chapter 1 introduces the enhanced features of the MSX2, and shows block figures and standard tables. This information is conceptual, but will be needed to understand descriptions in volume 2 and later.

FONTE
  MSX2 Technical Handbook (ASCII Corporation, 1987); texto em ingles, como no original.)MAN");

