    add("th2-chapter-5-access-to-peripherals-through-bios-sections-1-to-6", "", "Handbook: Chapter 5: Access to peripherals through BIOS (1-6)", "", "CHAPTER 5 - ACCESS TO PERIPHERALS THROUGH BIOS (Sections 1 to 6): The basic philosophy of...",
        R"MAN(LIVRO: MSX2 Technical Handbook (ASCII Corporation, 1987)
CAPITULO: Chapter 5: Access to peripherals through BIOS (1-6)

The basic philosophy of MSX is to have a standard interface, independent of machines or versions, to access peripherals through BIOS. Thus, the user should get to know about using BIOS first. In chapter 5, accessing peripherals using BIOS and the structure used for each peripheral are described.

FONTE
  MSX2 Technical Handbook (ASCII Corporation, 1987); texto em ingles, como no original.)MAN");

